[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290009392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110325#issuecomment-3290009392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110325","id":3290009392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EGY8w","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T23:06:40Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T23:13:43Z","body":"The ColorPicker Circle is a rect control. The circle is drawed by shader. Whether the circle is perfectly circular dependeds on whether the control's width and height are equal.\nThe ColorPicker's layout is as follows:\n\n<img width=\"753\" height=\"731\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/80da23dd-2ae6-46c2-b92f-9d1cbbcfb856\" />\n\nThe parent control `circle_margin` is a square, but it's `margin_bottom` is 8. So the `circle`'s height is shorter.\nThe code of the `margin_bottom`'s assignment is here:\n\n<img width=\"1292\" height=\"334\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d3f4c39-69af-4ba6-b3d4-a0dbdf89904a\" />\nThis line is added by @KoBeWi\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/ef0408e70433a070e70f1fe06eb4e3ccb758eee9#diff-80b7e0e780a5345f463dc46952f750e459a4b2d85ae6eaa9fb256261d50b8e3fR585\n\n ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290009392/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3356520389","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110325#issuecomment-3356520389","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110325","id":3356520389,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IEG_F","user":{"login":"zimonitrome","id":17656709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjU2NzA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17656709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome","html_url":"https://github.com/zimonitrome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T14:06:19Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T14:06:19Z","body":"How do you even notice this?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/